hs and lists.</span></label></div><div class="swc-divider"></div><div class="swc-field-grid"><label class="swc-field swc-field-full"><span class="swc-label">Featured image</span><div class="swc-file"><input type="file" name="image" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/gif,image/webp"><div class="swc-hint" style="margin-top:7px">Recommended 1080 × 1080 (square, like an Instagram post). JPG, PNG, GIF or WebP · maximum 5MB. Stored automatically in <code>uploads/blogs/</code>.</div></div></label><label class="swc-field"><span class="swc-label">Author name</span><input class="swc-input" name="author_name" value="Softwebco Team"></label><label class="swc-field"><span class="swc-label">Read time</span><input class="swc-input" name="read_time" value="5 min read"></label></div></div><div class="swc-form-actions"><a class="swc-btn swc-btn-ghost" href="bloglist.php">Cancel</a><button class="swc-btn swc-btn-primary" type="submit"><i class="bi bi-send"></i> Publish blog</button></div></section><aside class="swc-side-note"><img class="swc-image-preview" src="<?php echo htmlspecialchars(swc_blog_admin_image_url(SWC_BLOG_AUTHOR_IMAGE)); ?>" alt="Softwebco"><h3>Publishing checklist</h3><p>Use a clear title, useful excerpt and high-quality featured image.</p></aside></form>
